  <!-- What any Windows front end shares, apart from any one console (Docs/Shared-Libraries-Plan.md,
       phase 6): the presenters and their filters, DLSS and FSR, the texture upscaler's backends,
       the audio devices, the host's pads and mouse, the overlay, DPI and the dialogs. Includes
       Emu.Core and nothing of PSXEmu's, and never may. -->
